    {
      "id": "08d489a99ebe447eb87e99f018c96100",
      "title": "Mat-Su Borough Land Sales",
      "url": "https://maps.matsugov.us/portal/apps/webappviewer/index.html?id=611edfb8752543cfb582ef2fead35cc9",
      "publisher": "MatSuBorough",
      "status": "needs_review",
      "publisher_verified": false,
      "native_geography": null,
      "production_admission": false,
      "properties": {
        "snippet": "This interactive map viewer allows users to preview and research properties available through the Borough’s different land sale programs.",
        "extent": null,
        "commentsEnabled": true,
        "groupDesignations": null,
        "access": "public",
        "apiToken2ExpirationDate": -1,
        "typeKeywords": [
          "JavaScript",
          "Map",
          "Mapping Site",
          "Online Map",
          "Ready To Use",
          "Web Map"
        ],
        "description": "The Mat-Su Borough Land Sale Application has been developed as an interactive tool for previewing and researching properties available through the borough’s different land sale programs. The borough offers properties for sale through the Tax Foreclosure and Local Improvement District (LID) Foreclosure program as well as general land sales of borough owned properties. The application provides a mapping interface with the ability to view available properties, parcel boundaries, property and structure information, aerial imagery and topographic features. The application also provides useful links to the sale packets, recorded plats and assessment records through the MSB myProperty reports.    ",
        "licenseInfo": "<p style='margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.55rem; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;'><u><span style='color: rgb(31, 73, 125);'>Matanuska Susitna Borough Land Sale and Tax &amp; LID Foreclosure Sale Viewer</span></u></p><p style='margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.55rem; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;'><span style='color: rgb(31, 73, 125);'>The maps and information provided are for graphic representation only and are intended to be used for informational purpose.</span></p><p style='margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.55rem; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;'><span style='color: rgb(31, 73, 125);'>It is the responsibility of the user to determine parcel size, location, boundaries, access, costs, and any restrictions which may impact the parcel.</span></p><p style='margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.55rem; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;'><span style='color: rgb(31, 73, 125);'>All purchasers and bidders are responsible to read and understand the content of the individual sale brochures and to abide by all requirements set forth by MSB.</span></p><p style='margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.55rem; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;'><span style='color: rgb(31, 73, 125);'>For more information contact MSB Land &amp; Resource Management at:</span></p><p style='margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.55rem; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 17px;'><span style='color: rgb(31, 73, 125);'>907-861-7869 or <a href='mailto:lmb@matsugov.us' style='color: rgb(0, 121, 193); text-decoration-line: none;'>lmb@matsugov.us</a></span></p>",
